## How to Run This Project (Step-by-Step Guide)

This project has  "PyTorch Implementation" and supports:
1) **Offsite evaluation/training** (with metrics)  
2) **Onsite Kaggle submission generation** (CSV output)

The pipeline is controlled by two variables in the main block:
- 'backbone' (model architecture)
- 'task' (what operation to run)

